James requested assistance in transposing the authorship information of a paper titled "CLOSING THE CLIMATE-ECONOMICS COMMUNICATION GAP" into a citation format suitable for submission to *Nature Climate Change*. The original authors included S. C. Sherwood and others, with James Rising listed among them. I provided a properly formatted citation, maintaining the integrity of the original author list while ensuring it adhered to the style presented in an example citation for a different paper. The final format placed the authors in correct order and identified the publication year and title as necessary for academic referencing.
